{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca48132474a5d91020f1bee98954636dc3dde879206e4a58ac1f5ff4664daa27", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。今日一日、\n{$P$}にくっついて歩いてもいい？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}，我今天可以\n整天都贴着{$P$}走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7082b53be01a36fa2e7958ab244647448747747c0c45cb4164cdd0c63fc49b67", "ja": "くっついて歩く……って、\nまさか、ずっとそばにいるってことか？", "zh": "你说贴着走……\n意思是要一直待在我身边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
