{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "d888ebd4a71f5dde06fc818293cd4dc25b9337455e8567676e2e198833a55e76", "ja": "あ、違う違う！　全然、そういうのじゃなくってさ。\nえっと、占い？", "zh": "啊，不是不是！完全没有那回事啦。\n呃，就是占卜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
