{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "15dfa3b7511d9a885a9771d602b3344966344196d652167776c26c67a6fa5be9", "ja": "そ、星座占い！　モデルやった雑誌が届いたんだけど、\n今日のアタシの運勢、最悪なんだって……！", "zh": "对，星座占卜！我收到了之前刊有我模特儿照片的杂志，\n上面说我今天的运势很差……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "747f2a1cebd9af975b1a912471fa88cd6a71ea18b7e6db84551e8bcf0852b650", "ja": "でも、今日一日年上の人と一緒にいると、\n最高になるって書いてあったの！　だから、お願いっ！", "zh": "但也说要是今天一整天都跟年纪比较大的人待在一起，\n就能扭转运势！所以拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a91311aca62813956df8cd0e87f0f1540d3969bfda378587d7c3dae59f9f0a4", "ja": "なるほど……そういうことなら構わないけど、\n俺でいいのか？", "zh": "原来如此……这样的话我倒是无所谓，\n但跟着我真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "57f2a20443bc6bb063db835e8ea21b67b52092dff76825e4e118ef9f10fefe28", "ja": "もちろん！\n{$P$}がいいんだって～♪", "zh": "那当然！\n就是{$P$}才好啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "d116fe11c8ed8b9c570e437e94ffed6cbc58e1f9aa45d1f0cca684511d96e826", "ja": "あ、{$P$}も自分の占い読む？\nほら、このページ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}也想看自己的运势吗？\n来，是这页！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
