{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "60d13d799febb23260bfc7c7374fe805c4bd1c167aa1a37f430fbf89ac81f7d2", "ja": "え、ええっ！？\nウソっ、ホントに？　全然見てなかった……！", "zh": "咦、咦咦！？\n骗人，真的吗？我完全没看到……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "e736f9920492cdd34aaf0df25adfd253a81482fee14e7c702247d70479d17df7", "ja": "ち、違うんだってば～！\nアタシ、そこは見てなくって！　だから、えっと……。", "zh": "不、不是啦～！\n我没看到那边！所以，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
