{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0043_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8ccc3fd0bd18bd5841f555360098bcc7e29db3320e98589d97df594f44d5da74", "ja": "恵美！？　……ああ、行ってしまったか。", "zh": "惠美！？啊，走掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
